1
00:01:37,630 --> 00:01:42,970
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,370 --> 00:01:46,020
[Episode 25]

3
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:54,150
I had no idea he was coming

4
00:01:54,590 --> 00:01:55,950
to steal her away.

5
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:57,430
Shen Run

6
00:01:57,950 --> 00:01:59,640
was simply abusing

7
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:02,650
His Majesty's authority
and doing as he pleased.

8
00:02:02,710 --> 00:02:04,430
I only found out at the last moment—

9
00:02:04,430 --> 00:02:05,950
there was nothing I could do.

10
00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:08,430
Are you using the new Emperor
to intimidate me?

11
00:02:08,430 --> 00:02:09,120
No.

12
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,560
How would I dare?

13
00:02:12,030 --> 00:02:13,840
The new Emperor had the two of you

14
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,710
return here one after another—

15
00:02:16,710 --> 00:02:18,370
precisely so Shen Run could be

16
00:02:18,470 --> 00:02:20,870
the executioner's blade
meant to cut me down!

17
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:21,630
And you—

18
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:26,590
you're the executioner
standing beside that blade,

19
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,280
waiting for the order to strike.

20
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,280
Isn't that right?

21
00:02:37,310 --> 00:02:38,630
My dear brother,

22
00:02:38,630 --> 00:02:41,150
you mustn't frighten me like this.

23
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:43,079
How would I ever dare?

24
00:02:44,430 --> 00:02:45,470
Brother,

25
00:02:45,470 --> 00:02:47,520
ever since I entered officialdom,

26
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:51,680
you've always been my greatest support.

27
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:54,400
Without your backing,

28
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:56,590
I would be nothing.

29
00:02:57,310 --> 00:03:00,030
It was also your clever strategy

30
00:03:00,190 --> 00:03:02,560
to have me feign loyalty
to the new Emperor.

31
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,520
To put it bluntly,

32
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:06,360
I'm entirely

33
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:08,360
at your mercy here.

34
00:03:08,590 --> 00:03:12,250
How could I possibly harbor
the slightest disloyalty toward you?

35
00:03:21,030 --> 00:03:21,840
Jingzhi.

36
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,280
Yes.

37
00:03:23,150 --> 00:03:25,410
We've known each other for over 20 years.

38
00:03:25,430 --> 00:03:27,120
-Yes.
-You know me well.

39
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,470
-Sit.
-I…

40
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,310
Yes.

41
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:34,870
Brother,

42
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:37,910
Shen Run

43
00:03:38,910 --> 00:03:41,430
really doesn't know his place.

44
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:44,310
The moment he brought the Palace Guards

45
00:03:44,310 --> 00:03:45,870
into Hengtang,

46
00:03:46,190 --> 00:03:49,310
he was already in your grasp, Brother.

47
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:54,910
But I don't think this matter

48
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,520
is that simple.

49
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,120
For him to seize Qingyuan so brazenly,

50
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,320
in front of everyone—

51
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,700
could it really

52
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:05,560
just be about her?

53
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:08,080
Then...

54
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,430
He's seen through it.

55
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:14,800
He's seen through the fact
that we appear to be at odds

56
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:17,890
but are actually putting on a show
for the new Emperor.

57
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:21,360
If he really has seen through it,

58
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:25,040
this matter will become far more serious.

59
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,560
Yes.

60
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:31,480
Regardless,

61
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,190
that man

62
00:04:33,510 --> 00:04:35,190
is a grave threat to us.

63
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:36,600
We can't let him live for long.

64
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,190
We can't let him live for long—

65
00:04:38,190 --> 00:04:40,600
is that how you see it?

66
00:04:40,950 --> 00:04:41,600
Yes.

67
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,240
That's what I think too.

68
00:04:43,950 --> 00:04:44,680
But...

69
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,600
he's your new son-in-law.

70
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,740
Could you truly...

71
00:04:51,950 --> 00:04:53,280
bring yourself to do it?

72
00:04:59,310 --> 00:04:59,950
Brother,

73
00:05:00,750 --> 00:05:02,680
Qingyuan is my own flesh and blood,

74
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:03,630
but

75
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:05,870
it depends on the matter at hand.

76
00:05:06,270 --> 00:05:10,720
If it comes down to life and death,
the greater good must come first—

77
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:13,600
I can't afford to
concern myself with much else.

78
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,750
Then she'll just have to suffer for it.

79
00:05:16,510 --> 00:05:17,120
Come on, Brother.

80
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,190
It's a joyous occasion.

81
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:19,360
-I'm coming.
-Let's have a proper drink.

82
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,220
Where's Yunya?

83
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,270
Yunya!

84
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,240
My Lady, food's ready!

85
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,430
-Yunya, hurry up!
-Food's ready!

86
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:25,430
We're waiting for you!

87
00:05:25,430 --> 00:05:25,960
Darling!

88
00:05:27,190 --> 00:05:27,920
Coming!

89
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:31,950
-Darling!
-My Lady!

90
00:05:31,950 --> 00:05:33,159
-These...
-Hurry up!

91
00:05:33,159 --> 00:05:35,040
are my specialties.

92
00:05:35,510 --> 00:05:36,750
Well, not exactly my specialties.

93
00:05:36,750 --> 00:05:38,800
My real specialty is pastries.

94
00:05:39,750 --> 00:05:40,870
Come on, sit.

95
00:05:41,950 --> 00:05:44,040
Rather than exchanging empty pleasantries
with outsiders,

96
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:47,120
I'd rather have a drink
with you, my family.

97
00:05:47,390 --> 00:05:48,360
-Come on.
-Cheers. Cheers.

98
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,360
-Come on!
-Cheers!

99
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:51,560
-Come on, to a happy occasion.
-Cheers!

100
00:05:55,270 --> 00:05:58,400
Everyone thinks Commander Shen
is a ruthless official,

101
00:05:58,430 --> 00:06:00,870
but little do they know
that in front of my sister, Yunya,

102
00:06:00,870 --> 00:06:03,510
he's such a gentle and considerate man.

103
00:06:05,510 --> 00:06:06,950
Fangchun, once we part today,

104
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:08,430
I don't know when we'll meet again.

105
00:06:08,430 --> 00:06:08,870
Come on,

106
00:06:08,870 --> 00:06:10,160
let's have another drink.

107
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,750
-Come on.
-Cheers.

108
00:06:16,390 --> 00:06:17,310
That's enough.

109
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,760
We still have to leave the city tonight.

110
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,720
You think my alcohol tolerance
is as poor as yours?

111
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:24,720
I'm a legend when it comes to drinking.

112
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,680
I can drink all night

113
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:26,810
and never get drunk.

114
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,870
Don't just talk.

115
00:06:31,870 --> 00:06:33,000
Have some food.

116
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:33,950
-Come on, eat up.
-Come on.

117
00:06:33,950 --> 00:06:36,680
-You don't think it's very good, do you?
-Come on.

118
00:06:38,159 --> 00:06:42,159
I nearly forgot about
my specialty herbal chicken soup.

119
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:44,159
It's still on the stove.

120
00:06:44,310 --> 00:06:45,240
I'll go get it.

121
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:45,630
-Wait for me.
-Granny.

122
00:06:45,630 --> 00:06:46,750
Eat up, eat up.

123
00:06:46,750 --> 00:06:47,550
Don't mind me.

124
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,950
-Let me help you, Granny.
-I'm so forgetful today.

125
00:06:49,950 --> 00:06:51,210
Let's wait for Granny.

126
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,620
Let me offer everyone another toast.

127
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,270
Come on.

128
00:06:55,310 --> 00:06:55,870
Cheers.

129
00:06:57,100 --> 00:07:06,430
[Shen Residence]

130
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,250
Brother,

131
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,080
no need to see us off further.

132
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,000
Fangchun,

133
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,860
write to me when you have the time.

134
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,120
When we meet again someday,

135
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,190
we should drink together.

136
00:07:10,190 --> 00:07:10,830
Che,

137
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,390
take care of yourself.

138
00:07:12,390 --> 00:07:13,040
Also,

139
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:15,200
don't forget what I told you.

140
00:07:16,870 --> 00:07:17,400
Brother,

141
00:07:17,870 --> 00:07:18,470
take care.

142
00:07:21,510 --> 00:07:22,310
And you too.

143
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,870
Sister-in-law,

144
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:27,000
until we meet again.

145
00:07:34,820 --> 00:07:41,140
[Shen Residence]

146
00:07:35,190 --> 00:07:36,390
The road ahead is long!

147
00:07:36,390 --> 00:07:37,520
Until we meet again!

148
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,190
Che seems

149
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,510
different somehow.

150
00:07:48,270 --> 00:07:49,310
Have you noticed

151
00:07:49,950 --> 00:07:52,810
he appears to have
some feelings for Dong Fangchun?

152
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:53,950
Yunya.

153
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,040
Dear,

154
00:07:57,870 --> 00:07:59,870
I want to hear you call me "Darling."

155
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:09,300
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

156
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,160
Darling.

157
00:08:09,330 --> 00:08:13,860
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

158
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:18,180
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

159
00:08:18,210 --> 00:08:22,820
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

160
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:27,070
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

161
00:08:27,100 --> 00:08:31,660
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

162
00:08:31,690 --> 00:08:36,000
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

163
00:08:36,030 --> 00:08:41,780
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

164
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,490
Isn't this what you wanted?

165
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:49,190
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

166
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,440
What I want

167
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:49,220
is a marriage recognized
in name and in law.

168
00:08:49,220 --> 00:08:53,740
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

169
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:58,070
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

170
00:08:58,090 --> 00:09:02,700
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

171
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:06,950
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

172
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:11,540
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

173
00:09:11,570 --> 00:09:15,880
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

174
00:09:15,910 --> 00:09:22,370
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

175
00:09:41,270 --> 00:09:42,150
Dear.

176
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:52,530
Shen Run!

177
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:53,750
Shen Run!

178
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:54,630
Shen Run!

179
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:58,660
Commander.

180
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,550
What...

181
00:09:59,750 --> 00:10:00,360
What happened?

182
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,020
Commander!

183
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,000
Madam,

184
00:10:02,550 --> 00:10:04,120
with the Commander's skills,

185
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:07,920
how many people in this world
could ever get close enough to harm him?

186
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,510
Chen Qingyuan,

187
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,670
out of personal grudge,
you murdered your husband,

188
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:17,510
Shen Run, a second-rank court official

189
00:10:17,510 --> 00:10:19,750
and Commander of the Palace Guard.

190
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:21,600
The evidence is conclusive,

191
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,910
and we've caught you red-handed.

192
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:23,750
Seize her!

193
00:10:23,750 --> 00:10:24,390
Feng En!

194
00:10:25,390 --> 00:10:26,630
The Commander's body isn't even cold yet,

195
00:10:26,630 --> 00:10:28,600
and you dare slander his wife like this?

196
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,120
Feng En,

197
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:30,840
the truth hasn't been established yet.

198
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:31,910
What are you really after,

199
00:10:31,910 --> 00:10:34,170
pinning this crime on her so recklessly?

200
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:38,440
Commander Shen unfortunately
died in the line of duty.

201
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,770
By His Majesty's order,

202
00:10:39,910 --> 00:10:41,790
I've been appointed Acting Commander.

203
00:10:41,790 --> 00:10:43,320
Apprehending the real culprit

204
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,390
is my duty.

205
00:10:44,870 --> 00:10:47,750
Just because she's the Commander's widow,

206
00:10:47,910 --> 00:10:51,000
does that mean she should be cleared of
suspicion for having blood on her hands?

207
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,060
Acting Commander?

208
00:10:52,270 --> 00:10:53,790
The Commander has just
met with misfortune.

209
00:10:53,790 --> 00:10:55,360
Where did the imperial order come from?

210
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:57,220
Have you sold yourself to Hu Xing?

211
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,120
Traitor.

212
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,960
Whether she's the true culprit or not,

213
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:02,490
His Majesty and Commissioner Hu
will decide.

214
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,920
Take her away!

215
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:06,030
-Who dares to move?
-I'm the Second-Rank Lady of Honor,

216
00:11:06,030 --> 00:11:07,670
conferred by His Majesty himself.

217
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:08,630
To take me away,

218
00:11:08,790 --> 00:11:10,550
you'll need
the Court of Judicial Review's fish tally,

219
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:12,870
a warrant from the Vice Censor-in-Chief,

220
00:11:12,870 --> 00:11:14,480
and His Majesty's own vermilion rescript.

221
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,280
Only then will I so much as blink.

222
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:18,410
If this is reported to His Majesty,

223
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,770
every one of you will die

224
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,270
before I do!

225
00:11:24,870 --> 00:11:26,930
Want to torture me into a confession,

226
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:28,840
then silence me forever
so I can't contradict it?

227
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:29,570
I don't think

228
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,380
you have what it takes.

229
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:33,440
Very well.

230
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:36,140
Palace Guards, hear my order—

231
00:11:36,550 --> 00:11:37,550
from this day forward,

232
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:39,480
guard the Shen Residence closely,

233
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:42,510
especially this criminal woman
who killed your commander!

234
00:11:42,510 --> 00:11:43,320
Yes, sir!

235
00:12:07,030 --> 00:12:08,790
I've already had
the coroner examine the body.

236
00:12:08,790 --> 00:12:10,690
The knife wound
was indeed inflicted by this person,

237
00:12:10,690 --> 00:12:12,950
and Shen Run showed no sign of breathing.

238
00:12:13,270 --> 00:12:14,800
He is unquestionably dead.

239
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:32,960
Good!

240
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:36,130
A wise man knows
which way the wind is blowing.

241
00:12:37,550 --> 00:12:38,270
You...

242
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,440
are a wise man.

243
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:44,270
Though you serve His Majesty,

244
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,000
you understand that

245
00:12:46,670 --> 00:12:48,720
now that the new Emperor
has ascended the throne,

246
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:50,150
his ambitions

247
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,910
are nothing more

248
00:12:52,390 --> 00:12:53,870
than a passing breeze.

249
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:56,970
At most, it can strip
a few leaves from the tree.

250
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,450
But the great tree's

251
00:12:59,270 --> 00:13:01,730
roots run deep,
tangled beyond all tracing—

252
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,180
nothing can shake it to its roots.

253
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,480
Once the wind passes,

254
00:13:06,510 --> 00:13:07,600
everyone will

255
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:10,210
settle back into their places.

256
00:13:10,630 --> 00:13:13,480
And those who bend with the wind

257
00:13:14,150 --> 00:13:15,410
will meet a tragic end.

258
00:13:16,070 --> 00:13:17,870
You're right, Commissioner Hu.

259
00:13:18,030 --> 00:13:19,510
I've long since come to understand this.

260
00:13:19,510 --> 00:13:20,910
Now that Shen Run is dead,

261
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:23,920
I stand the best chance
of becoming the Commander.

262
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:24,750
But for that,

263
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:27,380
I still need your help, Commissioner Hu.

264
00:13:34,750 --> 00:13:35,510
I've

265
00:13:36,270 --> 00:13:38,550
always treated smart people well.

266
00:13:38,790 --> 00:13:39,590
Rest assured.

267
00:13:39,870 --> 00:13:42,110
Whatever I have,

268
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:45,030
you'll have your share.

269
00:13:45,870 --> 00:13:47,470
Thank you, Commissioner Hu.

270
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,030
Nine years ago,

271
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,630
Lord Shen Zhibai,

272
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:01,320
the Jiangnan Transport Commissioner,

273
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,850
sat right in this very chair

274
00:14:04,790 --> 00:14:07,270
and wrote
the Ten Suggestions on Equalization.

275
00:14:07,270 --> 00:14:09,000
At that time, we truly believed

276
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:12,080
the people would be well-fed
and warmly clothed from then on.

277
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,740
But who would have thought...

278
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:18,690
he'd be framed by the officials here
who joined forces against him.

279
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:20,970
and die in the prime of his life?

280
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,120
Nine years later,

281
00:14:23,910 --> 00:14:25,200
his eldest son,

282
00:14:25,460 --> 00:14:28,860
[Commander of the Palace Guard Shen Run]

283
00:14:25,870 --> 00:14:28,360
Shen Run, Commander of the Palace Guard,

284
00:14:29,030 --> 00:14:32,240
who was carrying out the Emperor's order
to investigate the old cases,

285
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,900
likewise met a violent death.

286
00:14:34,820 --> 00:14:37,410
[Mengliang]

287
00:14:38,750 --> 00:14:39,550
Gentlemen,

288
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:42,000
seeing you all return safely

289
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:45,390
has finally

290
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:46,840
lifted

291
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,960
a weight from my heart.

292
00:14:50,670 --> 00:14:52,550
You're too kind, Commissioner Hu.

293
00:14:52,550 --> 00:14:54,480
When it comes to the affairs of the court,

294
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,670
we are too insignificant

295
00:14:55,670 --> 00:14:56,800
to have any real say.

296
00:14:57,320 --> 00:15:00,120
But now,
with refugees flooding across Jiangnan,

297
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:02,270
if we turn a blind eye to this,

298
00:15:03,030 --> 00:15:06,960
all our years of studying the sages' teachings
will have been for nothing.

299
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,620
Yet with Commander Shen dead,

300
00:15:09,390 --> 00:15:11,480
the corrupt officials he once imprisoned

301
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,940
have all been reinstated.

302
00:15:13,830 --> 00:15:14,900
In Hengtang,

303
00:15:15,550 --> 00:15:18,750
is anyone still willing to
listen to the people's voices?

304
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:21,510
To our opponent,

305
00:15:22,630 --> 00:15:23,560
Commander Shen.

306
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:26,050
He has fought against us for years.

307
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:28,610
Today, everything can
finally be put to rest.

308
00:15:29,150 --> 00:15:31,720
We ought to send him off properly.

309
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:38,720
If no one in Hengtang
is willing to listen,

310
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:40,050
we'll go to the capital.

311
00:15:40,390 --> 00:15:41,920
If they still can't hear us,

312
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:43,520
then we'll shout louder.

313
00:15:43,900 --> 00:15:47,470
[Memorial Tablet of the Late Shen Run]

314
00:15:44,600 --> 00:15:45,910
If we're still not loud enough,

315
00:15:45,910 --> 00:15:47,710
then we'll shout with our lives!

316
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:49,960
The heads of Hengtang's 100,000 citizens,

317
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:51,550
one by one,

318
00:15:51,550 --> 00:15:53,630
could stretch all the way
to the steps of the imperial throne!

319
00:15:53,630 --> 00:15:55,030
I refuse to believe that,

320
00:15:56,150 --> 00:15:58,080
no matter how powerful Hu Xing is,

321
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:01,320
he can keep all of us under his thumb.

322
00:16:02,270 --> 00:16:02,960
Now,

323
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:05,600
Shen Run is gone.

324
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:07,360
At last, Hengtang

325
00:16:07,550 --> 00:16:09,270
can see clear skies again.

326
00:16:09,670 --> 00:16:10,480
Indeed.

327
00:16:11,510 --> 00:16:12,870
I hope you will

328
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,440
all return to your posts,

329
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:16,490
regroup, and rise once more.

330
00:16:16,750 --> 00:16:19,600
We must regain control of Hengtang.

331
00:16:20,150 --> 00:16:20,880
The rules...

332
00:16:22,750 --> 00:16:24,600
remain as they always were—

333
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:26,200
your interests

334
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:27,870
will remain yours.

335
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,080
Any objections?

336
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:33,000
Commissioner Hu.

337
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,320
For the imperial court,

338
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:37,790
for you, Commissioner Hu,

339
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:40,180
we shall serve with utmost devotion!

340
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:42,600
Good.

341
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:44,320
Then...

342
00:16:44,910 --> 00:16:46,750
let us celebrate!

343
00:16:48,870 --> 00:16:49,840
Come on!

344
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:50,670
Drink. Let's drink.

345
00:16:50,670 --> 00:16:51,730
Come on, fill it up.

346
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:57,510
Hengtang is ours again!

347
00:16:57,510 --> 00:16:58,120
Yeah!

348
00:16:58,790 --> 00:17:00,670
It's still ours!

349
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:14,839
Smells nice, doesn't it?

350
00:17:18,349 --> 00:17:20,680
This is the first jar of aged wine
we sealed

351
00:17:21,030 --> 00:17:22,510
when we first arrived at Hengtang.

352
00:17:22,510 --> 00:17:23,369
A fine vintage.

353
00:17:27,030 --> 00:17:28,160
I've said it before.

354
00:17:29,350 --> 00:17:30,270
This jar of wine

355
00:17:31,030 --> 00:17:33,070
must be saved for an important day,

356
00:17:34,070 --> 00:17:37,270
to share with important people

357
00:17:37,680 --> 00:17:38,940
and mark the occasion.

358
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:43,400
Yuting,

359
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,000
what's wrong?

360
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:58,520
Today, everything has
finally fallen into place.

361
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:00,640
It's a day to celebrate our victory.

362
00:18:00,830 --> 00:18:03,200
Why do you seem so downcast instead?

363
00:18:09,070 --> 00:18:11,270
I just suddenly feel all this is a bit...

364
00:18:11,830 --> 00:18:12,640
dull.

365
00:18:19,790 --> 00:18:20,960
Dull?

366
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:24,680
Returning to Hengtang this time

367
00:18:25,510 --> 00:18:27,200
was your idea.

368
00:18:27,720 --> 00:18:29,580
Controlling the canal transport

369
00:18:29,590 --> 00:18:31,720
and contesting your family headship—

370
00:18:33,110 --> 00:18:34,480
haven't you

371
00:18:35,350 --> 00:18:37,210
achieved everything you wanted?

372
00:18:38,590 --> 00:18:40,030
What else do you wish for?

373
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,890
I'll help you achieve that too.

374
00:18:45,790 --> 00:18:47,320
Whether it's in the capital

375
00:18:47,590 --> 00:18:48,790
or in Hengtang,

376
00:18:49,270 --> 00:18:50,510
it's always

377
00:18:51,350 --> 00:18:53,030
the same handful of faces

378
00:18:53,310 --> 00:18:55,170
and the same handful of families.

379
00:18:57,310 --> 00:18:58,680
And so what if we win?

380
00:19:00,550 --> 00:19:02,240
It's just a different stage

381
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:04,030
for the same old play.

382
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:12,500
I'm tired of it.

383
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:19,250
We finally came across
someone interesting.

384
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:26,790
Look at you.

385
00:19:28,110 --> 00:19:30,240
You've met every kind of man there is.

386
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:33,400
Why does Shen Run's death

387
00:19:34,110 --> 00:19:35,400
suddenly make you

388
00:19:37,030 --> 00:19:38,510
so sentimental?

389
00:19:49,400 --> 00:19:50,510
It's not about him.

390
00:19:52,350 --> 00:19:54,680
I just feel sorry for that perfect couple.

391
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:58,350
Before I could tear them apart myself,

392
00:19:58,830 --> 00:20:00,960
they were already separated by death.

393
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:05,270
It's really

394
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:07,700
taken some of the fun out of this play.

395
00:20:19,310 --> 00:20:20,070
Here.

396
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:42,140
In the past, we wrote articles

397
00:21:42,590 --> 00:21:44,510
so they would circulate in the capital.

398
00:21:44,510 --> 00:21:45,970
But this piece we write now

399
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:48,600
isn't for the officials,

400
00:21:49,720 --> 00:21:51,180
nor to protect ourselves.

401
00:21:52,270 --> 00:21:54,470
It's for whatever shred of humanity...

402
00:21:56,790 --> 00:21:58,390
still remains in our hearts.

403
00:22:05,550 --> 00:22:07,010
The article is finalized.

404
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:09,750
If any of you don't want to
be implicated in this,

405
00:22:09,750 --> 00:22:10,880
you may leave now.

406
00:22:11,510 --> 00:22:13,110
Those of you willing to stay,

407
00:22:14,110 --> 00:22:15,310
join me

408
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:18,080
in sending this article out.

409
00:22:22,590 --> 00:22:23,590
Lord Shen Zhibai

410
00:22:23,590 --> 00:22:24,590
and Commander Shen Run—

411
00:22:24,590 --> 00:22:26,640
both gave their lives
for the common people.

412
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:27,790
How could we possibly be afraid

413
00:22:27,790 --> 00:22:30,160
to put our names to this proclamation?

414
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:32,880
To plead for the people,

415
00:22:32,880 --> 00:22:34,200
I'd die without regret!

416
00:22:34,200 --> 00:22:36,240
I'd gladly go with you, Jieyuan Zhou!

417
00:22:36,240 --> 00:22:38,450
I'd gladly go with you, Jieyuan Zhou!

418
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:42,310
Mr. Zhou!

419
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:02,550
Third Lady Xie.

420
00:23:04,110 --> 00:23:04,920
Mr. Zhou.

421
00:23:08,510 --> 00:23:09,350
This time,

422
00:23:09,550 --> 00:23:11,080
don't copy the wrong sutra.

423
00:23:11,590 --> 00:23:12,920
Thank you, Senior Zhou.

424
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:14,680
If it weren't for you,

425
00:23:14,790 --> 00:23:18,190
I don't know how many times
I would've copied the wrong sutra.

426
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:20,930
And thank you for
keeping these papers for me.

427
00:23:20,960 --> 00:23:21,880
It's clear

428
00:23:22,160 --> 00:23:23,960
how deeply you miss your mother.

429
00:23:24,310 --> 00:23:25,030
How about

430
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:27,130
I draw a portrait of her for you?

431
00:23:28,510 --> 00:23:30,110
You know how to paint as well?

432
00:23:35,270 --> 00:23:38,270
I don't remember much of her.

433
00:23:39,750 --> 00:23:41,030
I only remember Mother

434
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:43,040
had a crisp, clear laugh.

435
00:23:43,270 --> 00:23:46,750
Her hair was very dark and glossy.

436
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:49,720
Whenever she held me,

437
00:23:50,270 --> 00:23:52,200
her hands always smelled so sweet.

438
00:23:52,310 --> 00:23:54,640
When Mother was pregnant with my brother,

439
00:23:54,720 --> 00:23:57,400
everyone was careful
not to let her tire herself out.

440
00:23:57,400 --> 00:23:58,660
But Mother doted on me.

441
00:23:59,550 --> 00:24:01,010
She would always pick me up

442
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:03,170
and spin me around the room.

443
00:24:08,830 --> 00:24:09,640
She...

444
00:24:11,350 --> 00:24:13,150
always spoke slowly and gently,

445
00:24:13,590 --> 00:24:15,050
never sharply or harshly,

446
00:24:15,590 --> 00:24:18,110
and her hair at the temples
was never messy.

447
00:24:23,070 --> 00:24:24,550
She had deep-set eyes,

448
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:27,640
with the corners of her eyes
slightly curved upward.

449
00:24:27,640 --> 00:24:29,300
But if anyone ever bullied me,

450
00:24:29,640 --> 00:24:31,370
her eyes would narrow sharply,

451
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:33,940
and she wouldn't back down to anyone.

452
00:24:41,310 --> 00:24:42,270
Your mother

453
00:24:42,680 --> 00:24:44,680
sounds like a truly special person.

454
00:24:46,270 --> 00:24:47,750
Why do you say that?

455
00:24:51,920 --> 00:24:54,180
No matter how neatly her hair was combed,

456
00:24:54,240 --> 00:24:55,440
it would come loose

457
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:57,640
if she spun you around the room.

458
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:58,750
You said

459
00:24:59,720 --> 00:25:01,380
her laugh was crisp and clear,

460
00:25:01,510 --> 00:25:03,680
yet her speech was slow and gentle.

461
00:25:05,270 --> 00:25:07,960
That doesn't sound like the same person.

462
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:13,960
Senior Zhou, you mean

463
00:25:15,270 --> 00:25:16,470
I remember her wrong?

464
00:25:19,440 --> 00:25:21,300
Could it be two different people—

465
00:25:21,790 --> 00:25:24,250
one fierce on the outside
but gentle within,

466
00:25:24,350 --> 00:25:27,350
and the other gentle on the outside
but fierce within?

467
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:30,440
It's just that you've
merged both of their virtues

468
00:25:31,350 --> 00:25:33,350
into a single person in your memory.

469
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:08,720
Mother,

470
00:26:09,350 --> 00:26:11,080
the herbal decoction is ready.

471
00:26:12,070 --> 00:26:13,130
Careful, it's hot.

472
00:26:17,920 --> 00:26:19,920
It was only a minor illness at first,

473
00:26:20,310 --> 00:26:21,910
and I didn't think much of it.

474
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:25,160
Who would've thought
it'd get worse day by day?

475
00:26:25,550 --> 00:26:27,750
I've taken
several doses of the decoction already,

476
00:26:27,750 --> 00:26:29,610
but there's been no improvement.

477
00:26:33,550 --> 00:26:36,070
Perhaps the decoction
just takes time to work.

478
00:26:36,070 --> 00:26:37,270
Take a few more doses.

479
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:39,270
I'm sure it'll help.

480
00:26:43,510 --> 00:26:46,240
The decoction I prepared for you
with my own hands

481
00:26:46,510 --> 00:26:48,770
carries all my filial devotion, Mother.

482
00:26:50,070 --> 00:26:51,590
Even Mr. Zhou said

483
00:26:53,070 --> 00:26:54,530
that my painting of Mother

484
00:26:55,030 --> 00:26:57,290
has traces of two different people in it.

485
00:26:57,680 --> 00:26:59,680
You've raised me since I was a child.

486
00:26:59,920 --> 00:27:03,850
Honestly, I barely remember
what my birth mother looked like anymore.

487
00:27:06,030 --> 00:27:07,400
The mother in my heart

488
00:27:07,960 --> 00:27:09,960
has actually always worn your face.

489
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:33,680
Mother,

490
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:35,700
was my birth mother

491
00:27:36,590 --> 00:27:38,640
really poisoned by euphorbia?

492
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:48,850
The wicked deed Mei Yinghua committed

493
00:27:49,440 --> 00:27:51,170
has already been established.

494
00:27:51,790 --> 00:27:53,240
Why are you

495
00:27:54,550 --> 00:27:56,350
bringing this up all of a sudden?

496
00:27:58,640 --> 00:27:59,680
I heard

497
00:28:00,720 --> 00:28:03,640
my birth mother's lips
were purple when she died.

498
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:08,140
That's not a sign of euphorbia poisoning

499
00:28:10,030 --> 00:28:11,160
but of suffocation.

500
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:17,240
I knew it.

501
00:28:17,750 --> 00:28:19,160
While I've been ill,

502
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:20,880
someone's been filling your head
with nonsense again.

503
00:28:20,880 --> 00:28:21,480
Mother.

504
00:28:23,920 --> 00:28:26,780
What you had me copy
was not the Rebirth Sutra at all,

505
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:30,370
but the Soul-Suppressing Mantra,

506
00:28:30,830 --> 00:28:31,480
right?

507
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:41,960
How is that possible?

508
00:28:42,590 --> 00:28:43,440
Indeed.

509
00:28:45,590 --> 00:28:47,050
How could my loving mother

510
00:28:48,790 --> 00:28:52,320
ever have me personally
suppress the spirit of my birth mother?

511
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:00,550
How could I...

512
00:29:01,350 --> 00:29:02,400
have had you copy

513
00:29:02,680 --> 00:29:04,410
the Soul-Suppressing Mantra?

514
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:08,330
Maybe you've copied the wrong one.

515
00:29:12,550 --> 00:29:13,790
Maybe you've copied the wrong one.

516
00:29:13,790 --> 00:29:14,720
I'll go check.

517
00:29:18,160 --> 00:29:20,220
Indeed. You've copied the wrong one.

518
00:29:20,590 --> 00:29:21,240
Well...

519
00:29:21,790 --> 00:29:23,400
Indeed, wrong sutra!

520
00:29:25,790 --> 00:29:27,390
It must've been some servant

521
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:29,530
who mixed up the two sutras.

522
00:29:29,830 --> 00:29:30,860
I'm to blame.

523
00:29:30,920 --> 00:29:32,200
I'm to blame!

524
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:38,750
Let's copy the right sutra later, okay?

525
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:40,410
Let's copy the right sutra,

526
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:41,750
okay?

527
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:44,510
Wrong sutra?

528
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:46,510
Mother,

529
00:29:48,030 --> 00:29:50,030
was it really just a mistake?

530
00:29:55,240 --> 00:29:55,880
Qingrong,

531
00:29:56,750 --> 00:29:57,950
do you really believe

532
00:29:58,240 --> 00:30:00,160
I would harm your mother?

533
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:06,920
You've been

534
00:30:07,920 --> 00:30:09,640
my daughter for 19 years.

535
00:30:10,550 --> 00:30:11,960
How have I treated you?

536
00:30:13,750 --> 00:30:15,510
Don't you trust me?

537
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:20,720
Trust me,

538
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:23,880
okay?

539
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:39,550
Of course I trust Mother.

540
00:30:43,070 --> 00:30:44,270
Good girl, Qingrong.

541
00:30:47,110 --> 00:30:48,110
My good Qingrong.

542
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:54,680
Mother.

543
00:30:58,000 --> 00:30:59,660
It's time for your decoction.

544
00:31:39,830 --> 00:31:41,510
I'll definitely finish...

545
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:45,030
the decoction

546
00:31:46,070 --> 00:31:47,310
you brewed for me.

547
00:32:07,750 --> 00:32:11,110
Purge the corrupt officials
and cleanse the Emperor's court!

548
00:32:11,110 --> 00:32:14,380
Purge the corrupt officials
and cleanse the Emperor's court!

549
00:32:14,380 --> 00:32:17,480
Purge the corrupt officials
and cleanse the Emperor's court!

550
00:32:17,480 --> 00:32:20,200
Purge the corrupt officials
and cleanse the Emperor's court!

551
00:32:20,200 --> 00:32:23,440
-These scholars.
-Purge the corrupt officials!

552
00:32:24,110 --> 00:32:27,670
-They shout nonstop all day.
-Cleanse the Emperor's court!

553
00:32:27,700 --> 00:32:31,160
Purge the corrupt officials
and cleanse the Emperor's court!

554
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:34,400
–Purge the corrupt officials!
-It's OK. Let's drink.

555
00:32:34,720 --> 00:32:35,830
Young people

556
00:32:35,830 --> 00:32:38,030
always carry lofty ideals.

557
00:32:38,160 --> 00:32:40,690
Naturally, they tend to be
a bit hot-blooded.

558
00:32:40,880 --> 00:32:41,550
Yes, yes.

559
00:32:41,550 --> 00:32:43,830
Look how magnanimous Commissioner Hu is.

560
00:32:43,830 --> 00:32:45,030
I heard

561
00:32:45,590 --> 00:32:48,030
the one leading them

562
00:32:48,200 --> 00:32:49,350
is Zhou Pei'an, right?

563
00:32:49,350 --> 00:32:51,590
He's even the top scholar in
the provincial imperial exam here, right?

564
00:32:51,590 --> 00:32:52,200
Yes.

565
00:32:52,240 --> 00:32:53,240
Yes, yes.

566
00:32:53,240 --> 00:32:54,750
What's so great about a top scholar
in the provincial imperial exam?

567
00:32:54,750 --> 00:32:56,400
Even the top scorer in the palace exam—

568
00:32:56,400 --> 00:32:58,330
one comes along every three years.

569
00:32:58,480 --> 00:32:59,680
Since the founding of our dynasty,

570
00:32:59,680 --> 00:33:01,640
there have been nearly a hundred of them.

571
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:02,550
A mere Jieyuan

572
00:33:02,550 --> 00:33:03,680
is nothing special.

573
00:33:03,840 --> 00:33:05,000
-Yeah.
-Yes.

574
00:33:05,440 --> 00:33:08,070
How many truly
prominent aristocratic families

575
00:33:08,070 --> 00:33:09,330
are there in the realm?

576
00:33:10,110 --> 00:33:11,240
Those students

577
00:33:11,550 --> 00:33:13,070
will never amount to anything.

578
00:33:13,070 --> 00:33:14,000
However much of a fuss they make,

579
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:15,480
could it possibly beat the uproar
Shen Zhibai made back then?

580
00:33:15,480 --> 00:33:16,160
Exactly.

581
00:33:16,550 --> 00:33:17,350
That's right.

582
00:33:17,440 --> 00:33:18,970
Even if he makes a huge fuss,

583
00:33:19,240 --> 00:33:20,720
once he offends Commissioner Hu,

584
00:33:20,720 --> 00:33:23,640
his whole family
could be wiped out in an instant.

585
00:33:27,030 --> 00:33:27,790
My Lords,

586
00:33:28,720 --> 00:33:30,160
the two generals have arrived.

587
00:33:30,160 --> 00:33:31,690
Who are these two generals?

588
00:33:32,070 --> 00:33:33,730
Greetings, Commissioner Hu!

589
00:33:41,240 --> 00:33:42,920
We've been waiting for you.

590
00:33:45,200 --> 00:33:46,070
They're

591
00:33:46,550 --> 00:33:48,750
Deputy Commander Wang
and Deputy Commander Zhao.

592
00:33:48,750 --> 00:33:50,920
They're renowned battle-hardened generals.

593
00:33:50,920 --> 00:33:51,750
Exactly.

594
00:33:52,750 --> 00:33:54,750
The right-hand men
of the Marquis of Danyang.

595
00:33:54,750 --> 00:33:55,720
Right, right.

596
00:33:56,440 --> 00:33:57,400
Commissioner Hu,

597
00:33:57,400 --> 00:33:59,660
you truly are blessed with good fortune.

598
00:34:02,310 --> 00:34:03,200
You flatter me.

599
00:34:03,830 --> 00:34:05,160
These two generals

600
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:07,590
are merely doing me the honor of coming.

601
00:34:07,590 --> 00:34:08,510
No, no, My Lord.

602
00:34:09,030 --> 00:34:10,760
We've long heard of
your formidable reputation.

603
00:34:10,760 --> 00:34:11,960
How could we not come?

604
00:34:12,230 --> 00:34:13,230
Generals,

605
00:34:13,920 --> 00:34:16,150
you've served under Li Shaoqun,

606
00:34:17,070 --> 00:34:18,510
Marquis of Danyang,

607
00:34:19,760 --> 00:34:21,560
for quite a long time now, right?

608
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:25,280
Now, as you can see,

609
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:29,940
he's shut himself away
behind closed doors.

610
00:34:30,070 --> 00:34:31,320
I believe

611
00:34:31,840 --> 00:34:34,480
it's time for the two of you

612
00:34:34,840 --> 00:34:36,110
to step forward.

613
00:34:36,550 --> 00:34:38,030
Time to come out,

614
00:34:38,280 --> 00:34:39,360
take a look around,

615
00:34:39,760 --> 00:34:41,150
and make a choice.

616
00:34:47,920 --> 00:34:48,550
Yes.

617
00:34:49,880 --> 00:34:52,000
I heard that Li Shaoqun has

618
00:34:52,550 --> 00:34:54,949
recently become quite the benevolent man,

619
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:57,280
wanting to use all the soldiers' rations

620
00:34:57,280 --> 00:34:58,480
for disaster relief.

621
00:34:58,800 --> 00:35:00,710
When Li Shaoqun is around,

622
00:35:00,710 --> 00:35:02,400
he commands respect and keeps order.

623
00:35:02,400 --> 00:35:04,670
But once he's gone,

624
00:35:04,880 --> 00:35:06,880
with only that pampered

625
00:35:06,880 --> 00:35:08,000
young son of his,

626
00:35:08,150 --> 00:35:10,410
what could his son possibly accomplish?

627
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:11,230
When the time comes,

628
00:35:11,230 --> 00:35:12,280
he won't be able to
hold things together at all.

629
00:35:12,280 --> 00:35:13,630
What could he accomplish?

630
00:35:13,630 --> 00:35:14,710
Generals,

631
00:35:15,190 --> 00:35:17,030
you'd better think carefully.

632
00:35:21,590 --> 00:35:22,280
You two,

633
00:35:24,190 --> 00:35:25,280
do you understand?

634
00:35:27,440 --> 00:35:28,280
Generals,

635
00:35:29,320 --> 00:35:30,630
what do you say?

636
00:35:37,670 --> 00:35:40,270
We're willing to follow you,
Commissioner Hu!

637
00:35:45,110 --> 00:35:48,440
After the incident,
I was brought back to the Xie Residence.

638
00:35:49,280 --> 00:35:52,030
I heard it was Old Madam who intervened,

639
00:35:52,960 --> 00:35:54,760
having Xie Shu persuade Hu Xing.

640
00:35:57,230 --> 00:35:59,030
Returning to the Xie Residence,

641
00:35:59,110 --> 00:36:01,150
I felt like a lost, wandering soul.

642
00:36:01,920 --> 00:36:05,710
Then, by chance,
I stumbled upon a shocking secret.

643
00:36:07,670 --> 00:36:09,760
My Lady, dinner is ready!

644
00:36:25,870 --> 00:36:27,570
[Lu Lingshu]

645
00:36:29,230 --> 00:36:30,590
My Lady?

646
00:36:31,660 --> 00:36:34,850
[Lu Lingshu]

647
00:36:37,670 --> 00:36:44,980
[Zhongwu Hall]

648
00:36:49,510 --> 00:36:50,280
Father.

649
00:36:53,360 --> 00:36:54,190
Chunzhi.

650
00:36:55,630 --> 00:36:56,230
Come here.

651
00:36:59,700 --> 00:37:01,780
[Zhongwu Hall]

652
00:37:06,400 --> 00:37:06,960
Sit.

653
00:37:08,730 --> 00:37:15,090
[Zhongwu Hall]

654
00:37:14,710 --> 00:37:15,320
Father.

655
00:37:16,760 --> 00:37:18,110
Since Commander Shen passed away,

656
00:37:18,110 --> 00:37:20,230
everything in Hengtang
has fallen into disarray.

657
00:37:20,230 --> 00:37:21,800
Father, do you have any plans

658
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:23,130
regarding this matter?

659
00:37:26,070 --> 00:37:26,880
Chunzhi,

660
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:28,760
recently,

661
00:37:29,280 --> 00:37:30,710
because of your marriage,

662
00:37:30,710 --> 00:37:33,110
you haven't stepped
out of the house at all—

663
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:35,720
you haven't even gone to
the military camp.

664
00:37:35,960 --> 00:37:37,560
I've been worried about you.

665
00:37:39,760 --> 00:37:40,360
Yes.

666
00:37:40,920 --> 00:37:41,920
It's my fault.

667
00:37:42,710 --> 00:37:44,840
I'm sorry to have worried you, Father.

668
00:37:45,280 --> 00:37:46,340
But Qingru and I...

669
00:37:46,670 --> 00:37:47,550
I know.

670
00:37:49,320 --> 00:37:51,190
You've always been thinking about

671
00:37:51,190 --> 00:37:53,120
the Xie family's fourth daughter.

672
00:37:54,840 --> 00:37:57,110
The moment you lifted the bridal veil,

673
00:37:58,670 --> 00:37:59,670
your mother and I

674
00:38:00,320 --> 00:38:01,670
could already see

675
00:38:01,670 --> 00:38:03,130
the reproach in your eyes.

676
00:38:04,590 --> 00:38:06,190
But what could be done?

677
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:08,590
That's simply fate.

678
00:38:12,630 --> 00:38:13,800
Back then,

679
00:38:14,510 --> 00:38:16,320
your mother and I were the same.

680
00:38:17,630 --> 00:38:18,710
After the wedding,

681
00:38:19,070 --> 00:38:20,670
we also had some bumps.

682
00:38:20,670 --> 00:38:22,320
Your mother, in a fit of anger,

683
00:38:22,320 --> 00:38:23,840
packed her belongings

684
00:38:24,510 --> 00:38:26,370
and ran back to her parents' home.

685
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:30,730
I've never heard you speak of this before.

686
00:38:32,550 --> 00:38:33,440
Chunzhi,

687
00:38:34,030 --> 00:38:35,070
marriage is a bond

688
00:38:35,630 --> 00:38:37,960
forged across 3 lifetimes,

689
00:38:38,440 --> 00:38:40,230
a fate cultivated over 1,000 years.

690
00:38:40,230 --> 00:38:43,320
You can't let a few harsh words
in a moment of anger

691
00:38:43,670 --> 00:38:45,630
sever that bond, right?

692
00:38:49,320 --> 00:38:50,070
Later,

693
00:38:50,840 --> 00:38:53,400
I took 2 jars of the finest aged wine

694
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:55,420
to your grandfather's house.

695
00:38:56,000 --> 00:38:59,190
That very night, your grandfather and I
drank deep into the night.

696
00:38:59,190 --> 00:39:00,000
And then?

697
00:39:00,670 --> 00:39:02,330
The very next day, your mother

698
00:39:02,480 --> 00:39:03,740
came back home with me.

699
00:39:05,670 --> 00:39:07,600
Though with conditions attached.

700
00:39:07,840 --> 00:39:08,880
From that day forward,

701
00:39:08,880 --> 00:39:09,550
your mother

702
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:14,230
made me promise
not to strike back, not to talk back.

703
00:39:14,670 --> 00:39:15,710
And I've kept to that,

704
00:39:15,710 --> 00:39:16,480
haven't I?

705
00:39:18,960 --> 00:39:20,070
Father, you're

706
00:39:20,590 --> 00:39:21,990
giving me a gentle nudge.

707
00:39:23,590 --> 00:39:24,880
A true man

708
00:39:25,920 --> 00:39:27,320
stands tall and upright.

709
00:39:31,110 --> 00:39:32,510
In this life...

710
00:39:36,230 --> 00:39:38,480
the one who accompanies you until the end

711
00:39:38,480 --> 00:39:39,610
is not your parents,

712
00:39:40,480 --> 00:39:41,590
nor your children,

713
00:39:42,280 --> 00:39:44,030
but your wife.

714
00:39:44,840 --> 00:39:46,630
She's like a mirror,

715
00:39:46,960 --> 00:39:48,690
reflecting your state of mind.

716
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:53,030
Qingru is a fine girl.

717
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:55,440
Once you've spent enough years together,

718
00:39:55,440 --> 00:39:56,440
and you reach my age,

719
00:39:56,440 --> 00:39:57,570
you'll understand—

720
00:39:58,480 --> 00:40:00,840
what kind of wife she becomes

721
00:40:01,400 --> 00:40:04,030
and what kind of mother she becomes

722
00:40:04,480 --> 00:40:05,670
isn't just up to her,

723
00:40:06,320 --> 00:40:07,320
but up to you.

724
00:40:11,840 --> 00:40:12,640
I understand.

725
00:40:13,360 --> 00:40:14,620
I understand, Father.

726
00:40:15,150 --> 00:40:17,750
I'll certainly
shoulder the responsibility.

727
00:40:19,150 --> 00:40:19,920
Chunzhi,

728
00:40:22,110 --> 00:40:23,310
in the blink of an eye,

729
00:40:23,550 --> 00:40:25,000
you've grown up.

730
00:40:26,510 --> 00:40:27,440
All grown up.

731
00:40:29,880 --> 00:40:30,590
Yes.

732
00:40:31,590 --> 00:40:32,670
Lately,

733
00:40:32,670 --> 00:40:35,480
I've often heard some things about you.

734
00:40:36,190 --> 00:40:37,070
They say

735
00:40:37,550 --> 00:40:39,190
that you're kind-hearted

736
00:40:39,550 --> 00:40:41,080
and have no ill intentions,

737
00:40:41,800 --> 00:40:43,070
so it'll be hard for you to preserve

738
00:40:43,070 --> 00:40:45,550
the future of our family.

739
00:40:46,510 --> 00:40:48,150
So what?

740
00:40:48,150 --> 00:40:51,190
You've already grown into the person
I hoped you'd be.

741
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:53,710
Who cares what others say?

742
00:40:59,480 --> 00:41:00,880
From now on...

743
00:41:05,840 --> 00:41:06,960
whatever...

744
00:41:10,840 --> 00:41:12,550
becomes of

745
00:41:12,840 --> 00:41:14,370
this Marquis's household,

746
00:41:14,840 --> 00:41:16,840
it shall have nothing to do with you.

747
00:41:18,230 --> 00:41:19,550
You are simply you.

748
00:41:22,400 --> 00:41:24,030
Just being yourself

749
00:41:24,760 --> 00:41:25,800
is enough.
